/-!
# Literal matrices and witnesses for the SU₃(5) coset table

The 126 right representatives are transcribed from the unchanged
`MiddleFactors/source/standard_flag_data.txt`, starting at line 133.
Exponent 24 encodes the source's −1 (zero); all other exponents encode ωⁿ.
`entry_spec` checks the coordinate lookup against these powers in F₂₅.
The transition triples give the two upper-root coordinates followed by the
full-torus coordinate. The recovery table distinguishes normalized bottom rows.
Their mathematical properties are checked in `Cosets.Checks`.

Source motivation: Guralnick–Malle Proposition 4.3, p.10;
Aschbacher–Smith K.2, printed p.453. `Cosets/source/generate.py` reproduces
these tables; the generator is not part of the trusted proof.
-/

